WEBVTT

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:02.892
I royally and epically
screwed something up.

00:01:03.518 --> 00:01:06.854
So, 2005, my wife JJ,

00:01:06.854 --> 00:01:10.399
driving along in slow-moving traffic
bumps into the guy in front of her.

00:01:10.817 --> 00:01:13.736
Police officer looks everything over,
doesn't see any damage,

00:01:13.736 --> 00:01:15.947
they exchange numbers
and they go on their way.

00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:17.490
A couple days later,

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.993
we get a notice that the guy
wants 836 dollars

00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:25.832
because, according to him,
the entire fender needs to be replaced.

00:01:26.624 --> 00:01:29.544
This is happening
during Hurricane Katrina.

00:01:29.585 --> 00:01:32.547
JJ and I had just been
to New Orleans on a trip,